        },
        {
          "id": "q-speaking",
          "kind": "production",
          "prompt": "Ask three choice questions: drinks, location, and time. Answer using a complete sentence.",
          "choices": [],
          "correct_choice_ids": [],
          "answer": "A: 你想喝水还是茶？ (Nǐ xiǎng hē shuǐ háishi chá?) — Would you like water or tea?\nB: 我想喝水。 (Wǒ xiǎng hē shuǐ.) — I would like water.\nA: 我们在这儿吃还是在那儿吃？ (Wǒmen zài zhèr chī háishi zài nàr chī?) — Shall we eat here or over there?\nB: 我们在这儿吃吧。 (Wǒmen zài zhèr chī ba.) — Let us eat here.\nA: 六点钟还是七点钟？ (Liù diǎn zhōng háishi qī diǎn zhōng?) — Six or seven o’clock?\nB: 七点钟吧。 (Qī diǎn zhōng ba.) — Seven o’clock.",
          "explanation": "Complete sample role-play. Practise both speakers, then substitute your own details."
        }
      ]
    }
